This poem is from Christina Rossetti's
_Sing-Song: A Nursery Rhyme Book_ (1872).

The Japanese rendition is by Yaso Saijō (1892 – 1970).#footnote[
 赤い鳥社 (1921).
 _Akai Tori_.
 April 1921 issue.
 p. 39
]
A recitation of the poem appears in Hayao Miyazaki's animated film
_The Wind Rises_ (2013).

